      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-and-other-legislation-amendment-omnibus.pdf, p.9",
      "values:originalText": "controlled drug)\nRepeal the definition, substitute:\nborder controlled drug:\n\n(a) means a substance that is a border controlled drug within the\nmeaning of subsection 301.4(1); and\n\n(b) to avoid doubt, includes a substance that is, under\nsubsection 301.4(2), (3) or 301.13(1A), taken, for the\npurposes of this Part, to be a border controlled drug only in\nrelation to particular offences against this Part or particular\nelements of those offences.",
      "skos:definition": "controlled drug)\nRepeal the definition, substitute:\nborder controlled drug:\n\n(a) means a substance that is a border controlled drug within the\nmeaning of subsection 301.4(1); and\n\n(b) to avoid doubt, includes a substance that is, under\nsubsection 301.4(2), (3) or 301.13(1A), taken, for the\npurposes of this Part, to be a border controlled drug only in\nrelation to particular offences against this Part or particular\nelements of those offences.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-and-other-legislation-amendment-omnibus-sch-2-sec-1-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "08d9a2a68e07d7eaa237d61439e187b669a28c710d6e5a049fd9b035c9038542",
      "skos:note": "Definition of border controlled drug"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-and-other-legislation-amendment-omnibus#sch-2-sec-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "1 Section 300.2 of the Criminal Code (definition of border",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 9,
      "values:originalText": "controlled drug)\nRepeal the definition, substitute:\nborder controlled drug:\n\n(a) means a substance that is a border controlled drug within the\nmeaning of subsection 301.4(1); and\n\n(b) to avoid doubt, includes a substance that is, under\nsubsection 301.4(2), (3) or 301.13(1A), taken, for the\npurposes of this Part, to be a border controlled drug only in\nrelation to particular offences against this Part or particular\nelements of those offences."
    },
