    {
      "@id": "concept:crimes-and-other-legislation-amendment-omnibus-sch-2-sec-8",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "8 At the end of section 301.4 of the Criminal Code",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-and-other-legislation-amendment-omnibus#sch-2-sec-8"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "crimes-and-other-legislation-amendment-omnibus.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "crimes-and-other-legislation-amendment-omnibus.pdf, p.10",
      "values:originalText": "Add:\n\n(2) However:\n\n(a) the regulations may provide that a listed border controlled\ndrug is taken, for the purposes of this Part, to be a border\ncontrolled drug only in relation to particular offences against\nthis Part, or particular elements of those offences; and\n\n(b) if the regulations so provide, then the listed border controlled\ndrug is taken, for the purposes of this Part, to be a border\ncontrolled drug only in relation to those offences or elements.\n\n(3) To avoid doubt, if a listed border controlled drug is taken, for the\npurposes of this Part, to be a border controlled drug only in relation\nto particular offences against this Part, or particular elements of\nthose offences, then a drug analogue of the listed border controlled\ndrug is taken, for the purposes of this Part, to be a border\ncontrolled drug only in relation to those offences or elements.\n\nBorder controlled drugs, plants and precursors  Schedule 2\n\nNo. 98, 2023\nCrimes and Other Legislation Amendment (Omnibus No. 2) Act 2023",
      "skos:definition": "Add:\n\n(2) However:\n\n(a) the regulations may provide that a listed border controlled\ndrug is taken, for the purposes of this Part, to be a border\ncontrolled drug only in relation to particular offences against\nthis Part, or particular elements of those offences; and\n\n(b) if the regulations so provide, then the listed border controlled\ndrug is taken, for the purposes of this Part, to be a border\ncontrolled drug only in relation to those offences or elements.\n\n(3) To avoid doubt, if a listed border controlled drug is taken, for the\npurposes of this Part, to be a border controlled drug only in relation\nto particular offences against this Part, or particular elements of\nthose offences, then a drug analogue of the listed border controlled\ndrug is taken, for the purposes of this Part, to be a border\ncontrolled drug only in relation to those offences or elements.\n\nBorder controlled drugs, plants and precursors  Schedule 2\n\nNo. 98, 2023\nCrimes and Other Legislation Amendment (Omnibus No. 2) Act 2023",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-and-other-legislation-amendment-omnibus-sch-2-sec-8-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:crimes-and-other-legislation-amendment-omnibus-sch-2-sec-8-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f552a1e79bdc74d313b3f0f000e309faa363c9b81f8db6b9d0fb2b41f0dcea48"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/crimes-and-other-legislation-amendment-omnibus#sch-2-sec-8",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "8 At the end of section 301.4 of the Criminal Code",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 10,
      "values:originalText": "Add:\n\n(2) However:\n\n(a) the regulations may provide that a listed border controlled\ndrug is taken, for the purposes of this Part, to be a border\ncontrolled drug only in relation to particular offences against\nthis Part, or particular elements of those offences; and\n\n(b) if the regulations so provide, then the listed border controlled\ndrug is taken, for the purposes of this Part, to be a border\ncontrolled drug only in relation to those offences or elements.\n\n(3) To avoid doubt, if a listed border controlled drug is taken, for the\npurposes of this Part, to be a border controlled drug only in relation\nto particular offences against this Part, or particular elements of\nthose offences, then a drug analogue of the listed border controlled\ndrug is taken, for the purposes of this Part, to be a border\ncontrolled drug only in relation to those offences or elements.\n\nBorder controlled drugs, plants and precursors  Schedule 2\n\nNo. 98, 2023\nCrimes and Other Legislation Amendment (Omnibus No. 2) Act 2023"
    },
